# yocto-recipe-gen.conf — project-local config for the yocto-recipe-gen skill.
#
# Copy this to `.yocto-recipe-gen.conf` in the directory you run the agent
# from (your Yocto project root / where you'd normally `source` your env),
# and edit ENV_SETUP to point at YOUR environment setup script — the one
# that does `source oe-init-build-env` AND sources the SDK environment.
#
# This file is sourced as plain shell by scripts/env_setup.sh, so ordinary
# VAR="value" assignments are all you need.

# Absolute path to your project's environment setup script. This is the
# single entry point the skill will `source` before every bitbake command.
ENV_SETUP="/home/youruser/yocto/setup-build-env.sh"

# Optional: arguments to pass to that script (e.g. a build dir name that
# oe-init-build-env expects). Leave empty/unset if your script takes none.
# ENV_SETUP_ARGS="build"
